Warning: spoily reply




















Whenever you can *avoid* Minotaurs like the plague. If you can get up
and down levels without him getting within melee range, that's precisely
what you want. Teleporting it isn't an option on that level of course.
He also has *no* resistances at all. Sleep or paralysis perhaps? 

BTW attacks *averages* 38hp/turn from them and it's *only* melee damage,
there is no range attack. 


